OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' anger over unfinished
OL,4,Anewbuild estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen David Maddison bought his newbuild
OL,7,Fhome in Shropshire, he was attracted by
OL,8,Fthe "fantastic location" and plans for
OL,9,Fa riverside park where he could
OL,10,Fexercise his seven rescue dogs.
OL,12,FFive years later, he says, residents
OL,13,Fare still waiting for many of the
OL,14,Ffeatures they were promised.
OL,16,FRoads and environmental works across
OL,17,Fthe Weir Hill and Lily Hay estate in
OL,18,FShrewsbury have been left unfinished,
OL,19,Fwhile developers have submitted plans
OL,20,Ffor a further 430 homes on adjacent
OL,21,Fland.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
