OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' anger over unfinished
OL,4,Anewbuild estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FShropshire Council has launched an
OL,7,Fenforcement investigation into the
OL,8,Funfinished works, although the
OL,9,Fdevelopers say outstanding landscaping
OL,10,Fand environmental improvements will be
OL,11,Fcompleted by 2027.
